{title: 17 Oh Padre, eterno Dios}
{key: F}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: Vicente Mendoza (1875-1955)}
{composer: Felice de Giardini, 1769 (1716-1796)}

{sov}
O[F]h Padre, etern[Gm]o D[C]ios,
[F]al[C]zamos[F] nuestra[C] voz
[F]en[C] gra[Am]ti[F]tud[C]
[F]por lo[C] que[F] tú[Bb6] nos[F] das
con[C] sin igual amor,
[Bb]y hallamos[F] dulce[C] paz
en ti, Se[F]ñor.
{eov}

{sov}
B[F]endito S[Gm]alvad[C]or,
[F]te[C] damos[F] con a[C]mor
[F]el[C] co[Am]ra[F]zón[C];
[F]acep[C]ta[F], oh[Bb6] Se[F]ñor,
lo que en tu altar
[Bb]venimos[F] a ofrendar
[C]cual vivo don[F].
{eov}

{sov}
E[F]spírit[Gm]u d[C]e Dios,
[F]es[C]cucha[F] nuestra[C] voz,
[F]y en[C] tu[Am] bon[F]dad[C]
[F]de[C]rrama[F] en[Bb6] nuestro[F] ser
di[C]vina claridad,
[Bb]copiosa[F] bendición
[C]y santi[F]dad.
{eov}
